msgstr "Personalizar los pasos del transpilador que se ejecutan en cada etapa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the product formula that Trotterizes an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate in fermionic space, either per gate or for a whole pipeline with [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") (see [Synthesize an Evolution gate in fermionic space](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation)).\n"
msgstr "Elegir la fórmula de producto que trotteriza una compuerta [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") en el espacio fermiónico, ya sea por compuerta o para todo un flujo con [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") (consulta [Sintetizar una compuerta Evolution en el espacio fermiónico](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation)).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implement custom fermion-to-qubit mappings by creating synthesis plugins (see [`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\")).\n"
msgstr "Implementar mapeos fermión a qubit personalizados creando complementos de síntesis (consulta [`F2QSynthesisPlugin`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-f-2-q-synthesis-plugin#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.F2QSynthesisPlugin\")).\n"

